# Gateway Focus 21 — "The Bridge" — ~33 min — theta base -> add 16 Hz BETA (audio-only) -> hold -> return
# Goal: Monroe Hemi-Sync Gateway "Focus 21" (The Bridge — the edge of the physical).
#       Establish a theta base, then transition into Focus 21 by fading in the 16.2 Hz
#       beta signature layers. Hold the bridge state, then fade the beta out and return.
# Method: BINAURAL — headphones REQUIRED (each layer is a true L/R carrier pair;
#         beat = freq_r - carrier). One audio channel per layer, pan 0 (centered).
#
# *** SAFETY-CRITICAL — 16 Hz IS AUDIO-ONLY ***
#   The Focus 21 signature beat is 16.2 Hz (beta). That rate sits squarely inside the
#   15-25 Hz photosensitive-seizure danger band. It is carried by the AUDIO binaural
#   layers ONLY. The LED MUST NEVER flicker at 16 Hz. The LED is pinned to 4 Hz theta
#   for the ENTIRE session (see the LED note below). Do not retune the light to the
#   beta layers under any circumstance.
#
# Measured layer table (reports/session_research/gateway_focus_construction_guide.md §1):
#   Theta base    : 200[4.0] · 250[4.0] · 300[4.0]  (NOTE: Focus 21 has NO 100 delta)
#   Focus 21 add  : 600[16.2] · 750[16.2] · 900[16.2]  (beta 16 signature — AUDIO ONLY)
#
# PATENT UPGRADE (reports/session_research/monroe_patents_guide.md §4a/§4b, US 5,356,368):
#   The dominant 4 Hz theta bed (the 200[4.0] pair, lowest-carrier theta) is now a SEPTON
#   multi-carrier stack — L 200/204/208 vs R 204/208/212 → simultaneous 4 Hz binaural AND
#   monaural beats, speaker-robust (guide §4b). A phased PINK-noise bed (wave 5, pan-LFO
#   L<->R 6 s, -18 dB under the dominant) rides beneath for the claimed +30% FFR (guide §4a).
#   Layer vols re-staged to the patent mix convention (guide §3): dominant ~65 (septon 3x22),
#   secondary theta -10..-15 dB, 16 Hz beta signature -15..-18 dB, pink bed -18 dB.
#   The 16.2 Hz beta stays AUDIO-ONLY — the pink bed / septon are 4 Hz-band only; NOTHING
#   here changes the LED, which is pinned to 4 Hz (safety block above).
# Channel map: SEPTON ch7=200 ch8=204 ch9=208 (4 Hz) · ch2=250[4.0] ch3=300[4.0] theta ·
#              ch4=600[16.2] ch5=750[16.2] ch6=900[16.2] beta (AUDIO ONLY) ·
#              ch10=pink bed (phased L<->R, 6 s)
# Amplitudes: septon 4 Hz theta ~22 ea (dominant ~65 total); secondary theta ~30;
#             16 Hz beta ~18 (subtle, in the mix); pink bed ~8 (-18 dB).
#
# LED (SAFETY §3/§4): flicker HELD at 4 Hz theta the WHOLE session — never the 16 Hz
#   audio beat. Dim violet, brightness <=25% with a 15 s ramp-in and a gentle breathing
#   LFO; calm and steady. No saturated-red strobe, no red<->blue. Volume fades in 60 s.
#
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (guidelines 5a): a > prefix sits on the row where
# a segment BEGINS; its value is the start, the target is the next same-channel/field
# row's value, swept over the gap. A layer is introduced by starting its channel at the
# phase time and fading its volume in.

# --- Prep / fade-in (00:00-03:00): calm 4 Hz SEPTON theta, LED + vol ease in ---
0 4 50 >0 90 0 200 15   # LED 4 Hz theta, violet, brightness ramps 0->22% over 15 s
A 0 200 0 >0 0 7 204 7  # septon a 200->204 (4 Hz): vol fades 0->22 over 60 s
A 0 204 0 >0 0 8 208 7  # septon b 204->208 (4 Hz)
A 0 208 0 >0 0 9 212 7  # septon c 208->212 (4 Hz)
A 0 200 ~-100:100:6000 >0 0 10 0 5   # ch10 phased PINK bed: pan L<->R 6 s, vol fades 0->8
S 3000 default 20 "Settle in and let the body grow still. Breathe slowly, easily, and let yourself relax."
15000 4 50 22 90 0 200 15   # brightness reaches 22% (ramp-in >=15 s done)
30000 4 50 ~16:24:12000 90 0 200 15   # gentle breathing: brightness sine 16<->24% over 12 s
A 60000 200 0 44 0 7 204 7  # septon a reaches 22, held
A 60000 204 0 44 0 8 208 7  # septon b reaches 22
A 60000 208 0 44 0 9 212 7  # septon c reaches 22
A 60000 200 ~-100:100:6000 16 0 10 0 5   # ch10 pink bed reaches vol 8, held (-18 dB)

# --- Theta base (03:00-08:00): bring in 250/300[4.0] ---
A 180000 250 0 >0 0 2 254 7  # ch2 theta 250[4.0]: vol fades 0->30 over 60 s (secondary)
A 180000 300 0 >0 0 3 304 7  # ch3 theta 300[4.0]
S 180000 default 20 "Sinking into a calm, steady theta — mind awake, body asleep. Rest at the threshold."
A 240000 250 0 60 0 2 254 7  # ch2 reaches 30 (secondary, ~-7 dB)
A 240000 300 0 60 0 3 304 7  # ch3 reaches 30

# --- Transition to Focus 21 (08:00-10:00): fade IN the 16.2 Hz beta (AUDIO ONLY) ---
A 480000 600 0 >0 0 4 616.2 7  # ch4 600[16.2] beta: vol fades 0->18 over 120 s (subtle)
A 480000 750 0 >0 0 5 766.2 7  # ch5 750[16.2] beta
A 480000 900 0 >0 0 6 916.2 7  # ch6 900[16.2] beta
S 480000 default 20 "Moving now toward Focus Twenty-One. A brighter, clearer edge begins to open."
A 600000 600 0 36 0 4 616.2 7  # ch4 reaches 18 (signature, subtle -15..-18 dB)
A 600000 750 0 36 0 5 766.2 7  # ch5 reaches 18
A 600000 900 0 36 0 6 916.2 7  # ch6 reaches 18

# --- Hold at the Bridge (12:00-28:00 = 16 min): full stack, steady ---
S 720000 default 20 "You are at the Bridge — the edge of the physical. Open, aware, and unafraid. Simply notice what is here."
S 1200000 default 20 "Steady and clear. Rest at the boundary and let whatever comes, come."

# --- Return (28:00-31:00): fade the 16 Hz beta out (back toward theta) ---
A 1680000 600 0 >36 0 4 616.2 7  # ch4 beta fades 18->0 over 120 s (leaving Focus 21)
A 1680000 750 0 >36 0 5 766.2 7  # ch5 beta fades out
A 1680000 900 0 >36 0 6 916.2 7  # ch6 beta fades out
S 1680000 default 20 "Gently now, stepping back from the edge, returning toward the calm theta."
A 1800000 600 0 0 0 4 616.2 7  # ch4 silent
A 1800000 750 0 0 0 5 766.2 7  # ch5 silent
A 1800000 900 0 0 0 6 916.2 7  # ch6 silent

# --- Soft close (31:00-33:00): fade theta base + LED to zero ---
1860000 4 50 >22 90 0 200 15   # LED brightness begins soft fade 22->0
A 1860000 200 0 >44 0 7 204 7  # septon a fades 22->0 over 120 s
A 1860000 204 0 >44 0 8 208 7  # septon b fades out
A 1860000 208 0 >44 0 9 212 7  # septon c fades out
A 1860000 250 0 >60 0 2 254 7  # ch2 theta fades out
A 1860000 300 0 >60 0 3 304 7  # ch3 theta fades out
A 1860000 200 ~-100:100:6000 >16 0 10 0 5   # ch10 pink bed fades 8->0
S 1920000 default 20 "Coming all the way back to the room now, calm, clear, and whole."
A 1980000 200 0 0 0 7 204 7  # end: all volumes 0 — septon a silent
A 1980000 204 0 0 0 8 208 7  # septon b silent
A 1980000 208 0 0 0 9 212 7  # septon c silent
A 1980000 250 0 0 0 2 254 7
A 1980000 300 0 0 0 3 304 7
A 1980000 200 ~-100:100:6000 0 0 10 0 5   # ch10 pink bed silent
1980000 4 50 0 90 0 200 15   # end: brightness 0

S 1980000 default 20 "WAKE UP!"
S 1990000 default 40 "WAKE UP!"
S 2000000 default 50 "WAKE UP!"
S 2010000 default 60 "WAKE UP!"
